Hello everyone,

We will have a fire drill at the London office and warehouse on Thursday 3 September at 11:00.

When the alarm sounds:
- Stop what you are doing and leave by the nearest exit. Do not use the lift.
- Do not stop to collect bags or coats.
- Go to the meeting point in the car park, next to the green gate.
- Stay there until a fire warden tells you it is safe to go back in.

The fire wardens this year are Lee for the warehouse and me for the office. We will check that everyone is out, so please make sure you signed in at reception if you are a visitor.

Drivers who are out on their routes do not need to come back for the drill.

Kind regards,
Priya
